# Design Narrative
# Mechanic: A copied token chooses a creature type before entering the battlefield.
# Forcing: Molten Duplication copies the only permanent target, Roaming Throne.
# AI behavior: The opponent has no hand or battlefield decisions.
# Failure modes: A missing choice prevents entry; success leaves two Thrones with independent chosen types.
# Card roles: Molten Duplication creates the token; Roaming Throne supplies the entry choice; Mountains pay the spell cost.
# Protocol path: Cast, SelectTargets, static subtype SelectN, then battlefield state and priority.

